{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2023-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1680307200, "end_date": 1682899199, "month_true_total": 19, "quota": 19, "returned": 19, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:09:17 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "137566394", "author": {"steamid": "76561199046891845", "personaname": "Miasokombinatt ★", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/miasokombinatt/", "num_games_owned": 627, "num_reviews": 282, "playtime_forever": 1065, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 307, "last_played": 1695137641, "avatar": "067279985681e78baa0a5648d41b64a0e76fda43"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's my first Steam game!", "timestamp_created": 1682876500, "timestamp_updated": 1682876500, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "137509630", "author": {"steamid": "76561198864720623", "personaname": "Drog", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RealDrog/", "num_games_owned": 70, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 141, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 105, "last_played": 1704681841, "avatar": "d1001ebab8977b6e956a68ba02554d1629433957"}, "language": "english", "review": "Eggplant emoji crab emoji fire emoji gun emoji", "timestamp_created": 1682801432, "timestamp_updated": 1682801432, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48888888955116272", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "137498968", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992510991", "personaname": "British Sharp", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197992510991/", "num_games_owned": 2875, "num_reviews": 111, "playtime_forever": 1074, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1074, "last_played": 1682788150, "avatar": "20856f8c086eef1074bcba0b15d9b5415c7cc693"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fantastic game. Truly one of the best of it's kind. Short and easy to understand, yet very challenging and hard to master.\n\n-Variation: There are so many different weapons, tools, characters and classes to pick from to engage the missions at hand. I had a blast trying out different builds and sometimes, frustrated until I learned how to use them. Each have their positives and negatives, making it quite balanced. When it comes to classes, there might be an unbalance of importance. For instance, Tech is usually mandatory while the other classes not so much. Medic is usually incredibly necessary for higher difficulties while officers and special weapons are not that necessary but very good at damage. Overall they all have their benefits, making it different flavours for different tastes and they are all good.\n\n-Difficulty: This game is hard. Even on the lower difficulties, I have died at least 100 times and usually on the first group of enemies. Learning the tips and tricks like when to use melee, which weapons to use, jumping, running in circles, will allow you to dominate. I still have a lot to learn even though this game is quite short, there are a lot of details hidden in obscurity that I still need to learn. \n\n-Campaign: Insanely good, very polished and straightforward. It has the Left 4 Dead/Valve polish to it, making it tense and quite addictive to play. The story is great and it is exactly what I would want from the Alien franchise, alas this has nothing to do with the Alien movies and they are stuck making very bad games like Colonial Marines.\n\n-Online: Pretty dead but it is possible to solo. Friends make this game way better.\n\n-Graphics: Very good for a free to play game that released in 2010. The darkness and lightning effects are done very well, adds to the tension and the environment you are sent on. There is so much detail in this game, it is shocking that this does not have a price tag for consumers.\n\n-Sound: Impeccable. From your scanner beeping to the sound of your reload, everything is done with such high quality. Very impressive.\n\n-Downside: Unfortunately to really enjoy this game, you need friends or people online to play with. I only 100% it recently because a friend casually asked me if I wanted to do speedruns and I said obviously said yes. The real potential of this game is when you have a full lobby. It is chaos and so entertaining to watch your teammates die when you have the chance to save them. Playing with less than 4 is like any co-op game, quite lacklustre sometimes.", "timestamp_created": 1682789980, "timestamp_updated": 1682789980, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545853912830352783", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "137489062", "author": {"steamid": "76561199381017675", "personaname": "Njemach", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199381017675/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 487, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 487, "last_played": 1689497007, "avatar": "1e56aa21620ce65aa0fe7cb503b032161551eaf4"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is OK but not the best one I've played.", "timestamp_created": 1682781927, "timestamp_updated": 1748778453, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment